  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0419.adelon_dramaton.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0419.adelon_dramaton.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0419.adelon_dramaton.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0419_adelon_dramaton"><head>ΑΔΗΛΩΝ ΔΡΑΜΑΤΩΝ</head><pb n="734" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:752" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="i" author_heading="Aristomenes" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-adelon_dramaton-i">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0419-adelon_dramaton-i-l1">Ἀκρατιοῦμαι μικρόν, εἶθ᾽ ἥξω πάλιν</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0419-adelon_dramaton-i-l2">ἄρτου δὶς ἢ τρὶς ἀποδακών.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus I p. 11 d. de verbo ἀκρατίζεσθαι disserens: Ἀριστομένης Ἀκρατιοῦμαι κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Primum versum ex Athenaeo petiit Eustathius ad Odyss. p. 1791 37. Respicit locum Phrynichus App. soph. p. 23 15. <quote>ἀκρατίσασθαι: τὸ μικρὸν ἐμφαγεῖν πρὸ τοῦ ἀρίστου. Ἀριστοφάνης (sic) ἀκρατιοῦμαι μικρόν.</quote> V. Hist. crit. p. 212.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="ii" author_heading="Aristomenes" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-adelon_dramaton-ii">
              <note type="source">Pollux VII 167: Ἀριστομένης δὲ ὁ κωμικός φιλακόλουθος ἄρχεται.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Fuit qui ἔρχεται corrigeret. Sed quis praestet poetam non acumen petiisse ex oppositis? ut sensus sit, qui alias sequacem se praestitit, nunc ipse rei initium facit. Φιλακόλουθος ex Aristoph. Ran. 416 assumpsisse videtur.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="iii" author_heading="Aristomenes" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-adelon_dramaton-iii">
              <note type="source">Harpocratio p. 127 9: ὅτι δὲ καὶ οἱ δοῦλοι ἀφεθέντες ὑπὸ τῶν δεσποτῶν ἐτέλουν τὸ μετοίκιον, ἄλλοι τε τῶν κωμικῶν δεδηλώκασι καὶ Ἀριστομένης.</note>
            </div>
            </div></body></text></TEI>